<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
    <title>CAPTCHA</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
    <script src="/static/app.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="shell">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">KISIA CTF · MISC</p>
        <h1>CAPTCHA</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          120초 안에 60개의 문자열을 연속으로 해독하세요.
          한 번 틀리면 streak는 0으로 돌아갑니다.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="status-grid" aria-label="도전 상태">
        <div class="metric">
          <span class="metric-label">STREAK</span>
          <strong><span id="streak">0</span><span class="muted"> / </span><span id="target">60</span></strong>
        </div>
        <div class="metric">
          <span class="metric-label">TIME LEFT</span>
          <strong id="timer">02:00</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="metric connection">
          <span class="metric-label">SESSION</span>
          <strong id="session-state">READY</strong>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="challenge-card">
        <div id="idle-panel" class="idle-panel">
          <p>세션은 시작 버튼을 누르는 순간부터 120초 동안 유지됩니다.</p>
          <button id="start-button" class="primary" type="button">도전 시작</button>
        </div>

        <div id="round-panel" class="round-panel hidden">
          <div class="image-frame">
            <span id="image-placeholder">CAPTCHA를 불러오는 중…</span>
            <img id="captcha-image" alt="현재 CAPTCHA" hidden>
          </div>

          <form id="answer-form" autocomplete="off">
            <label for="answer">해독한 문자열</label>
            <div class="answer-row">
              <input
                id="answer"
                name="answer"
                type="text"
                minlength="4"
                maxlength="7"
                pattern="[abcdefghjkmnpqrstuvwxyz23456789]{4,7}"
                placeholder="4~7 characters"
                autocapitalize="none"
                autocomplete="off"
                spellcheck="false"
                required
              >
              <button id="submit-button" class="primary" type="submit">제출</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <button id="next-button" class="secondary hidden" type="button">다음 CAPTCHA</button>
          <p id="message" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <pre id="flag" class="flag hidden"></pre>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        API를 직접 사용하려면 <a href="/docs">Swagger UI</a>를 확인하세요.
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
